  "origin": "Parliamentary records from the Norwegian parliament, OCR-derived, extracted from the Norwegian Colossal Corpus (NCC) published by the National Library of Norway. DFM filtered the NCC parliament subset to Danish: language classified as Danish with threshold 0.75, plus minimum-length, alpha-ratio, stop-word, and duplicate filters. The filtering reduced 9,528 parliament documents to 1,077 (1.08K samples, 338.87M Llama-3 tokens). Recurring OCR errors and historic expressions in older texts can make Norwegian/Danish differentiation difficult.",
